+# mrkernel Exynos2200 ChangeLog
+
+## v1.0-mrkernel (2025-05-30)
+- Branding: Renamed to mrkernel_exynos2200
+- Default config: performance/perf flags, debug, ZRAM, LRU_GEN
+- Scheduler: mr_schedutil governor, SCHED_CORE
+- I/O: anticipatory tweaks, mq-deadline defaults
+- Memory: ZRAM writeback, slab optimizations
+- Security: KASLR, UAO, randomize base
+- GPU: DVFS profiles, cooling devices
+- Net: tuned TCP buffers, NAPI params
+- UART: low latency module param
+- Thermal: adjusted trip points
+- Logging: streamlined printk, ftrace safety
+- CI: GitHub Actions matrix, mrkernel_defconfig check
+- Docs: README & docs/changes.md
+- Code style: .clang-format, checkpatch in CI
+- Misc: SELinux fallback, IRQ USB fix, early printk
+
+## Planned v1.1 (TBD)
+- Add real-time patch integration
+- Power efficiency enhancements
+- Upstream backports
