-# android_kernel_samsung_exynos2200
+# mrkernel Exynos2200

+Welcome to **mrkernel**, a custom kernel for the Samsung Galaxy S22+ (Exynos2200).
+
+## Features
+- High-performance scheduler (`mr_schedutil`)
+- Enhanced I/O and memory management (ZRAM writeback, anticipatory I/O)
+- Security hardening (KASLR, UAO, randomize_base)
+- Tailored GPU DVFS and thermal controls
+- Tuned networking for 5G throughput
+- Low-latency UART and USB patches
+- Integrated CI and code style checks
+
+# Build Instructions
+```bash
+ make mrkernel_defconfig ARCH=arm64 CROSS_COMPILE=aarch64-linux-gnu-
+ make -j$(nproc) ARCH=arm64 CROSS_COMPILE=aarch64-linux-gnu-
+```
